# Create graphs
created graph graph1
created graph graph2

# Add nodes to the graphs
added node n1 to graph1
added node n2 to graph1
added node n3 to graph2
added node n4 to graph2

# Add edges to the graphs
added edge e1 from n1 to n2 in graph1
added edge e2 from n3 to n4 in graph2

# Print the nodes in the graphs
graph1 contains: n1 n2
graph2 contains: n3 n4

# Print the outgoing edges in the graphs
the children of n1 in graph1 are: n2(e1)
the children of n3 in graph2 are: n4(e2)